                "senses": [
                    {
                        "sense_id": "91cc35b5-e2bc-3365-b6c4-829a71b725ab",
                        "entry_id": "2a7085d8-d5aa-3507-90ce-17f246874557",
                        "glosses": [
                            "filling (substance such as amalgam used to fill a cavity in a tooth)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "examples": []
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "ce8b9092-5935-3178-be1b-bbf84aea892d",
                        "entry_id": "2a7085d8-d5aa-3507-90ce-17f246874557",
                        "glosses": [
                            "seal (to hold something closed)"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "13dcdd5a-0dc9-4236-b838-20e73ffc576c",
                                "sense_id": "ce8b9092-5935-3178-be1b-bbf84aea892d",
                                "text": "[...] staremi plombami średniowiecznemi, które powstały z pieczęci i były używane zamiast podpisu, aby nadać walor autentyczności dokumentowi, do którego je przytwierdzano, a przeto bywają nazywane znakami prawnemi[...]",
                                "translation": "… the old medieval seals, which developed from stamps and were used instead of a signature, in order to give the virtue of authenticity to the document they were attached to, and are thus called legal signs …",
                                "english": "… the old medieval seals, which developed from stamps and were used instead of a signature, in order to give the virtue of authenticity to the document they were attached to, and are thus called legal signs …"
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "48ca7d5d-8295-4198-8728-8c565d314f67",
                                "sense_id": "ce8b9092-5935-3178-be1b-bbf84aea892d",
                                "text": "Długo i trwożnie ryczała lokomotywa i stanęła.\nJacyś ludzie z latarniami podbiegli do ciemnego wagonu.\nZerwali plombę i odsunęli drzwi.\n— Hej, wychodźcie! — zawołał starszy kolejarz z wąsami, okrytemi szronem i soplami lodu.",
                                "translation": "The locomotive roared long and frighteningly, then stood still.\nSome people with lanterns ran up to the dark train car.\nThey tore the seal off and opened the doors.\n\"Hey, come out!\" shouted an older railway worker with a moustache covered with frost and icicles.",
                                "english": "The locomotive roared long and frighteningly, then stood still.\nSome people with lanterns ran up to the dark train car.\nThey tore the seal off and opened the doors.\n\"Hey, come out!\" shouted an older railway worker with a moustache covered with frost and icicles."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "f49d5d5c-7819-40bb-9ee7-96442d59a02b",
                                "sense_id": "ce8b9092-5935-3178-be1b-bbf84aea892d",
                                "text": "Kupiłem laptopa z dwuletnią gwarancją producenta. Po roku sprzęt popsuł się, więc wysłałem go do serwisu. Ten odmówił naprawy argumentując, że naruszone są naklejki-plomby.",
                                "translation": "I bought a laptop with a two-year warranty from the manufacturer. After a year, the device broke, so I sent it to the company. It refused the repair, arguing that the seal stickers are broken.",
                                "english": "I bought a laptop with a two-year warranty from the manufacturer. After a year, the device broke, so I sent it to the company. It refused the repair, arguing that the seal stickers are broken."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "bfbaff4c-5237-4e46-8c82-605d7730fbfe",
                                "sense_id": "ce8b9092-5935-3178-be1b-bbf84aea892d",
                                "text": "Według polskiej Inspekcji Weterynaryjnej, mięso (słonina) z polskiej firmy wyjechało zaopatrzone w stosowny certyfikat, na samochodzie-chłodni znajdowała się polska plomba.",
                                "translation": "According to the Polish Veterinary Inspection, the meat (salo) left the Polish company provided with an appropriate certification; on the cooler-car there was a Polish seal.",
                                "english": "According to the Polish Veterinary Inspection, the meat (salo) left the Polish company provided with an appropriate certification; on the cooler-car there was a Polish seal."
                            },
                            {
                                "example_id": "aee65a52-1dd9-40ce-8667-d16cec63815a",
                                "sense_id": "ce8b9092-5935-3178-be1b-bbf84aea892d",
                                "text": "Wicepremier, minister rolnictwa i rozwoju wsi Henryk Kowalczyk z ministrem polityki rolnej i żywności Ukrainy Mykołą Solskim ustalili 3 marca, że tranzyt ukraińskiego zboża przez Polskę, zarówno drogowy, jak i kolejowy, będzie zabezpieczony przez plombowanie. Plomby będą zdejmowane w koncesjonowanych magazynach portowych albo w innych krajach, wskazanych jako docelowe.",
                                "translation": "Deputy prime minister and minister of agriculture and rural development Henryk Kowalczyk, along with Ukraine's minister of agricultural policy and food, Mykola Solski, decreed on March 3rd that the transit of Ukrainian grain through Poland, by road as well as by rail, will be kept secure by sealing. The seals will be taken off in contracted harbor warehouses or in other countries identified as final destinations.",
                                "english": "Deputy prime minister and minister of agriculture and rural development Henryk Kowalczyk, along with Ukraine's minister of agricultural policy and food, Mykola Solski, decreed on March 3rd that the transit of Ukrainian grain through Poland, by road as well as by rail, will be kept secure by sealing. The seals will be taken off in contracted harbor warehouses or in other countries identified as final destinations."
                            }
                        ]
                    },
                    {
                        "sense_id": "453e53c2-3cc3-3c47-a7b3-c9b4d2545058",
                        "entry_id": "2a7085d8-d5aa-3507-90ce-17f246874557",
                        "glosses": [
                            "a building built between two preexisting buildings along a street, which fully fills the gap between them"
                        ],
                        "tags": [
                            "feminine"
                        ],
                        "examples": [
                            {
                                "example_id": "dd26e070-3e4d-4c4b-90c2-29ca9f94b422",
                                "sense_id": "453e53c2-3cc3-3c47-a7b3-c9b4d2545058",
                                "text": "– Projekt dopuszcza dobudowanie budynku do innego budynku odwróconego do niego ślepą ścianą, t[ak-]zw[anej] plomby – mówi Tomasz Żuchowski, wiceminister Infrastruktury i budownictwa.",
                                "translation": "\"The project allows the construction of a building with a blind wall touching another building, a so-called filling,\" says Tomasz Żuchowski, deputy minister of infrastructure and construction.",
                                "english": "\"The project allows the construction of a building with a blind wall touching another building, a so-called filling,\" says Tomasz Żuchowski, deputy minister of infrastructure and construction."
                            }
                        ]
                    }
